+# [MP8] Set by the first of Host, Local or Customization: a second press during the fade would wait on the
+# same fade_finished (fade_overlay emits it early when restarted) and call get_tree() on the menu the first
+# has already taken out of the tree, which kills a release build. Each handler returns before it
+# writes GameManager, so the first press's mode is the one the next scene gets.
+var mp8_leaving := false
 
 signal container_hidden()
 
